cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this release and the upstream work credited in README.md."
title: "A formally verified 24-state Goldbach Turing machine"
type: software
authors:
  - name: aimir
    website: "https://github.com/aimir"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aimir/goldbach_tm"
url: "https://github.com/aimir/goldbach_tm/releases/tag/v0.1.0"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-12
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A 24-state binary Turing machine whose blank-tape halting is equivalent
  to a counterexample to Goldbach's conjecture, with an end-to-end Lean proof.
  The machine and proof adapt Yijun Leng's 25-state construction.
